<title>UK: Sedgwick forms jv with Italy's Nikols.</title>
<headline>Sedgwick forms jv with Italy's Nikols.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurance broker Sedgwick Plc said on Tuesday that it was forming a joint venture company with Italy's Nikols Insurance Brokers.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement that both companies will be merging their operations in Italy and in the main countries in southern Europe and Latin America.</p>
<p>Sedgwick said the move supports its objective to be one of the top three brokers in each European country in which it operates.</p>
<p>It gave no financial details.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
